{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghrpoTG5BhAWN51WLcin","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015QsTDkj7fjUEi5wXPwwnVT","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n '/^## 1[0-9]*\\. Humanoid/,+3p' API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-200 | head -3; grep -n 'Humanoid' API-INDEX.md | head -5 | cut -c1-200; LN=$(grep -n '^- `new E.Humanoid' API-INDEX.md | head -1 | cut -d: -f1); sed -n \"${LN},$((LN+6))p\" API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-1200","description":"Read Humanoid constructor options from API index"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7624,"cache_read_input_tokens":158901,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7624},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a6e08c15-1510-4ccd-89c0-2fe447fbc059","uuid":"2b29e664-2d09-478b-ad6a-edff6ecf5d2a","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:07:07.863Z","request_id":"req_011CghrpoAthuPr9LoZsPdhR","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_015QsTDkj7fjUEi5wXPwwnVT":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050253__x8ffc89/work/Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050253 && sed -n '/^## 1[0-9]*\\. Humanoid/,+3p' API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-200 | head -3; grep -n 'Humanoid' API-INDEX.md | head -5 | cut -c1-200; LN=$(grep -n '^- `new E.Humanoid' API-INDEX.md | head -1 | cut -d: -f1); sed -n \"${LN},$((LN+6))p\" API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-1200","description":"Read Humanoid constructor options from API index"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_015QsTDkj7fjUEi5wXPwwnVT":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050253__x8ffc89/work/Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050253"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015QsTDkj7fjUEi5wXPwwnVT","type":"tool_result","content":"## 11. Humanoid rig\n\n- `new E.Attack(spec = {}, over) → slash`: new E.Attack(spec) or new E.Attack('slash', { reach: 9 }): a name from E.MOVES plus overrides\n69:- 638 Humanoid rig; E.Attack: slash, E.Combo: combo, E.Humanoid: rig\n121:- `E.HEIGHTS: eye, chest, level, step`: the numbers of THE HEIGHT RULES, which collision, standing, sight, reach, navigation and drawing all read (API.md, \"Heights\", and the API index's head give \n638:## 11. Humanoid rig\n646:- `slash.state`: what Humanoid.update wants as `attack` (null when idle)\n660:- `combo.state`: what Humanoid.update wants as `attack` (null when idle)\n- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\n- `rig.debug(r)` †: skeleton overlay for debugging, draws straight into the buffer\n- `rig.draw(g, ox, oy, view)`: draw into g with (ox, oy) = projected position of the rig's root\n- `rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, size = 40, o = {})` †: a close-up bust for dialog boxes and menus, drawn live from the rig (blinks, hair and hats included): rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, 40, { zoom: 3, turn: .6, bg: '#1a2050', frame: true }) // inside r.overlay(g => ...) zoom: pixels per world unit (3 = face fills the frame), turn: 0 = facing you, .6 = three-quarter. The bust stays upright while the rig kneels or lies down (upright: false shows the real pose); cape: false hides the cape; tint: '#808080' greys it out (a KO'd party member).\n- `rig.drawSmear(r, colors = ['#ffffff', '#dff8ff', '#8fe0f2', '#4bb1d4'])` †: motion smear for the current swing, queued in front of the rig\n- `rig.hand(which = 'R')`: world position of a hand ('R' holds the weapon): spawn bullets, sparks or thrown things here\n- `rig.head()`: world position of the head (for speech bubbles, portraits, halos)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a6e08c15-1510-4ccd-89c0-2fe447fbc059","uuid":"6918f0c2-6b1e-489e-b4b3-df86f72202c7","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:07:07.883Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## 11. Humanoid rig\n\n- `new E.Attack(spec = {}, over) → slash`: new E.Attack(spec) or new E.Attack('slash', { reach: 9 }): a name from E.MOVES plus overrides\n69:- 638 Humanoid rig; E.Attack: slash, E.Combo: combo, E.Humanoid: rig\n121:- `E.HEIGHTS: eye, chest, level, step`: the numbers of THE HEIGHT RULES, which collision, standing, sight, reach, navigation and drawing all read (API.md, \"Heights\", and the API index's head give \n638:## 11. Humanoid rig\n646:- `slash.state`: what Humanoid.update wants as `attack` (null when idle)\n660:- `combo.state`: what Humanoid.update wants as `attack` (null when idle)\n- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\n- `rig.debug(r)` †: skeleton overlay for debugging, draws straight into the buffer\n- `rig.draw(g, ox, oy, view)`: draw into g with (ox, oy) = projected position of the rig's root\n- `rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, size = 40, o = {})` †: a close-up bust for dialog boxes and menus, drawn live from the rig (blinks, hair and hats included): rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, 40, { zoom: 3, turn: .6, bg: '#1a2050', frame: true }) // inside r.overlay(g => ...) zoom: pixels per world unit (3 = face fills the frame), turn: 0 = facing you, .6 = three-quarter. The bust stays upright while the rig kneels or lies down (upright: false shows the real pose); cape: false hides the cape; tint: '#808080' greys it out (a KO'd party member).\n- `rig.drawSmear(r, colors = ['#ffffff', '#dff8ff', '#8fe0f2', '#4bb1d4'])` †: motion smear for the current swing, queued in front of the rig\n- `rig.hand(which = 'R')`: world position of a hand ('R' holds the weapon): spawn bullets, sparks or thrown things here\n- `rig.head()`: world position of the head (for speech bubbles, portraits, halos)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015QsTDkj7fjUEi5wXPwwnVT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
