{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghsbe9fzJDJq6rYGCEcy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Most of these have a few causes. The tap helper steps only one frame, so presses get lost; the flask test checks the wrong monster; the PlayStation glyph default is never applied at boot; and a fallen hero's own bot can trigger a continue, which should only come from a player. I'll fix each and rerun."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":898,"cache_read_input_tokens":296637,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":898},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a6e08c15-1510-4ccd-89c0-2fe447fbc059","uuid":"c0afdc95-7146-4d63-92e3-39690f8eb3f9","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:17:27.538Z","request_id":"req_011CghsbdoahaR9fxTeghJZD"}
