{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cght3ki2ocPZqMCtxjtKz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012GZjcQBF6reG5SBUhuwAFm","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='game/src/80-about.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"    'Music, sound and voice are generated in code. No audio files.',\"\nassert s.count(old)==1\ns=s.replace(old,\"    'Music and sound come from the engine, which generates them in code. No audio files. No voices in this build.',\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > ENGINE-CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes (my-3D2dge v0.85.2)\n\nNo engine files were changed. `my-3d2dge.js` in this folder is the handoff copy, unmodified.\n\nThe plan asked for eight engine changes (E1 to E8). None were made. Each was worked around in the game code:\n\n| Plan | What it asked for | What was done instead |\n|---|---|---|\n| E1 | A multi-source flow field | One `E.FlowField` per living hero; each monster follows the field of its nearest hero |\n| E2 | Axe, bow, shield, pan and other gear on Humanoid rigs | Not made. Heroes use the sword, staff or no weapon the engine supports, and the standard hats |\n| E3 | Bullets that bounce off walls, and `onWall` | Not made. Shots stop at walls; cracked walls are not in this build |\n| E4 | Ignore Pad9 while Pad8 is held | Not made. The hub's Create and Options rule does not apply, since there is no hub session |\n| E5 | PlayStation symbols by default, a Settings choice for Xbox | Done in game code: `game.input.glyphs` is set at start-up from the saved choice |\n| E6 | TV scale, row widgets for any screen, hidden Dev groups | Not made. The game draws its own menus at its own size |\n| E7 | Per-player initials entry on the arcade table | Not made. Initials are filled from the class tag |\n| E8 | A voice bus with its own volume | Not made. There are no voices in this build |\n\nTest for the one change made in code: `tests/run.mjs dev` checks the controller symbols with the default and with Xbox.\nEOF\nnode build.mjs >/dev/null && timeout 900 node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -2 && ls -la .. | head -30","description":"Fix music credit line, write ENGINE-CHANGES.md, rebuild and test"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":892,"cache_read_input_tokens":348272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":892},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a6e08c15-1510-4ccd-89c0-2fe447fbc059","uuid":"fe57724b-98d3-4da9-94f2-1b1d7d0983bc","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:23:18.764Z","request_id":"req_011Cght3kPSiYShRqXqbG1Qy","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_012GZjcQBF6reG5SBUhuwAFm":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050253__x8ffc89/work/Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050253 && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='game/src/80-about.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"    'Music, sound and voice are generated in code. No audio files.',\"\nassert s.count(old)==1\ns=s.replace(old,\"    'Music and sound come from the engine, which generates them in code. No audio files. No voices in this build.',\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > ENGINE-CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes (my-3D2dge v0.85.2)\n\nNo engine files were changed. `my-3d2dge.js` in this folder is the handoff copy, unmodified.\n\nThe plan asked for eight engine changes (E1 to E8). None were made. Each was worked around in the game code:\n\n| Plan | What it asked for | What was done instead |\n|---|---|---|\n| E1 | A multi-source flow field | One `E.FlowField` per living hero; each monster follows the field of its nearest hero |\n| E2 | Axe, bow, shield, pan and other gear on Humanoid rigs | Not made. Heroes use the sword, staff or no weapon the engine supports, and the standard hats |\n| E3 | Bullets that bounce off walls, and `onWall` | Not made. Shots stop at walls; cracked walls are not in this build |\n| E4 | Ignore Pad9 while Pad8 is held | Not made. The hub's Create and Options rule does not apply, since there is no hub session |\n| E5 | PlayStation symbols by default, a Settings choice for Xbox | Done in game code: `game.input.glyphs` is set at start-up from the saved choice |\n| E6 | TV scale, row widgets for any screen, hidden Dev groups | Not made. The game draws its own menus at its own size |\n| E7 | Per-player initials entry on the arcade table | Not made. Initials are filled from the class tag |\n| E8 | A voice bus with its own volume | Not made. There are no voices in this build |\n\nTest for the one change made in code: `tests/run.mjs dev` checks the controller symbols with the default and with Xbox.\nEOF\nnode build.mjs >/dev/null && timeout 900 node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -2 && ls -la .. | head -30","description":"Fix music credit line, write ENGINE-CHANGES.md, rebuild and test"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_012GZjcQBF6reG5SBUhuwAFm":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050253__x8ffc89/work/Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050253"}}}
