R2 · Magic right-click, Q or △ · Pause Esc or Options\",\n    \"tags\": [\"co-op\", \"arcade\", \"fantasy\", \"comedy\", \"retro\"]\n  }\n}\nEOF\npython3 -c \"import json;d=json.load(open('$D/exit-interview.json'));print('parses', len(d['testingFeedback']), len(d['engineFeedback']), len(d['promptFeedback']))\"","description":"Rewrite the exit interview to match the current build"}}}
